cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "SCINET: cell-type-specific interactome reconstruction at single-cell resolution"
abstract: >-
  SCINET rescores the edges of a reference interactome using gene activity
  scores derived from single-cell expression, subsampling cells so that each
  edge receives a distribution rather than a point estimate. The result is one
  weighted network per cell type or cell state.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/shmohammadi86/SCINET"
